  "title": "Aspasia of Miletus",
  "summary": "Aspasia, born in Miletus, moved to Athens as a resident foreigner around 450 BCE and became the companion of Pericles after his divorce. Little is certain: Plutarch is the main source, and ancient comic poets attacked her. She bore Pericles a son who was later granted citizenship.",
